/**
 * The two consent facts a field-study participant gives separately.
 * Deliberately not one flag. ``RESEARCH_DATA`` covers the measurements --
 * geometry, quality metrics, the derived record. ``RAW_PHOTO_RETENTION``
 * covers keeping the photographs themselves for a bounded window. A
 * participant may grant the first and refuse the second, and the second may be
 * withdrawn later without invalidating the first.
 */
